    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Will the Storm Ever Stop?&quot;: Enter the Unknown Memoirs of 'Stormy Night</strong></h2><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/c80f754d10fe00247d01f8412e34c26f.poster.avif?t=1707313581\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/c80f754d10fe00247d01f8412e34c26f.webm?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/c80f754d10fe00247d01f8412e34c26f.mp4?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;<strong><u>Unknown Memoirs is an episodic psychological horror game</u></strong>&quot;<br><br><strong>&quot;Stormy Night&quot;</strong> takes the player through a horrifying journey where a  <strong>Never Ending Storm</strong> brings with it paranormal events.<br><br><strong><u>This is a short story horror game experience</u> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/4a24a45b01b8727158b06fd2b294abc0.poster.avif?t=1707313581\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/4a24a45b01b8727158b06fd2b294abc0.webm?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/4a24a45b01b8727158b06fd2b294abc0.mp4?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>News breaks that there have been strange sightings as <strong>The Storm</strong> enters its third week. The player, stuck in their apartment, tries to go about live as usual, but is quickly swept into a horrific spiral that <strong>The Storm</strong> seems to have brought with it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/0d4711e6aa59445ce38db0310f0c3428.poster.avif?t=1707313581\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/0d4711e6aa59445ce38db0310f0c3428.webm?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/0d4711e6aa59445ce38db0310f0c3428.mp4?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players will have to brave <strong> The Storm</strong> and find a way to survive as everything around them starts to fall apart. Will you be able to survive <strong>The Storm</strong>?, or rather what was brought along with it...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The main genre of the game is &quot;Walking simulator&quot;;<br></li><li> Gameplay is close to realism;<br></li><li> The game uses a unique 4:3 aspect ratio, mimicking the feeling of &quot;found footage&quot;;<br></li><li> Physics objects have been incorporated into the game that the player can interact with;</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/3033cf8fa160207f81dbffdf68f0a963.poster.avif?t=1707313581\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/3033cf8fa160207f81dbffdf68f0a963.webm?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2760610/extras/3033cf8fa160207f81dbffdf68f0a963.mp4?t=1707313581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
